Third-party data
----------------

The category catalog in db/catalog.json is derived in part from the Laravel
Package Ocean dataset:

  Source:     https://github.com/HassanZahirnia/laravel-package-ocean
  License:    MIT
  Copyright:  (c) 2023 Hassan Zahirnia

The remaining catalog entries were compiled from the packages covered by
Laravel News (https://laravel-news.com/category/packages). Only package
names were taken; categorization is our own.

Package metadata and download statistics are retrieved from the packagist.org
API (https://packagist.org/apidoc).
